window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-e49d01f23299a44c"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"codex-on-mobile\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"codex\">在移动设备上使用 Codex</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-guide-and-review-tasks-from-your-phone\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">用手机启动、指导并检查任务</h2> <p>你可以在手机上跟踪进度、批准操作并发送指示。Codex 可以在云端运行，也可以在已连接的电脑上运行。</p> <p>请使用 ChatGPT 移动应用，并选择 Cloud 或已连接的 Mac、Windows 电脑。此功能是否可用，取决于功能发布进度和工作区设置。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 移动应用中的 Codex 交互界面，展示 Cloud、已连接的电脑、任务、对话、审批和已修改文件。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-here\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">从这里开始</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e49d01f23299a44c?anchor=set-up-remote\">设置移动访问</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">远程连接指南</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"codex-on-mobile-advantages\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex_1\">Codex 移动版的优势</h2> <ul> <li><strong>用手机启动任务：</strong> 选择 Cloud 和一个运行环境，或选择已连接的电脑及项目，然后描述任务。</li> <li><strong>随时指导任务：</strong> 打开任务、跟踪进度，并在无需回到桌前的情况下发送新的指示。</li> <li><strong>批准待处理操作：</strong> Codex 在已连接的电脑上继续运行之前，你可以先检查并批准相关命令和操作。</li> <li><strong>检查任务结果：</strong> 查看回复、变更文件、差异和测试结果，再决定下一步。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"set-up-remote\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"get-started-on-mobile\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">在移动设备上开始使用</h2> <p>连接电脑、批准访问，然后开始第一个任务。</p> <ol> <li><strong>在电脑上开始设置。</strong> 在 Mac 或 Windows 电脑上打开 ChatGPT 桌面应用。前往 <strong>设置</strong> &gt; <strong>连接</strong> &gt; <strong>控制此 Mac 或 PC</strong>，然后选择 <strong>设置</strong> 或 <strong>添加</strong>。批准远程访问，并完成可能要求的验证步骤。</li> <li><strong>扫描二维码。</strong> 用手机扫描二维码，登录同一个 ChatGPT 账号和工作区，然后批准连接。只连接你自己拥有且信任的设备。</li> <li><strong>用手机开始工作。</strong> 在 iOS 版 ChatGPT 移动应用中打开 <strong>Codex</strong>，选择已连接的电脑，然后开始或继续任务。如果你的移动应用仍显示 <strong>Remote（远程）</strong>，请改为打开该入口。请让电脑保持唤醒并联网。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"keep-work-moving-from-anywhere\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">随时随地继续工作</h2> <p>你可以在手机上启动、批准并检查任务。Codex 会在组织的安全策略下执行工作。</p> <p><a id=\"1-see-tasks-across-your-hosts\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"1\">1. 查看不同主机上的任务</h3> <p>跟踪 Cloud 和各台已连接电脑上的活动任务，继续现有对话，并查看何时需要你提供信息。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：Codex 移动版任务列表，展示 Cloud 和已连接的电脑。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"2-approve-requests\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"2\">2. 批准请求</h3> <p>在 Codex 继续于已连接电脑上工作之前，检查相关命令和操作请求。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：Codex 移动版中要求批准终端命令的请求。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"3-review-changed-code\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"3\">3. 检查变更的代码</h3> <p>在手机上查看已修改的文件和代码差异，再决定下一步。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：Codex 移动版中带有代码差异的已修改文件审查页面。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"4-start-new-tasks\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"4\">4. 开始新任务</h3> <p>选择 Cloud 和一个运行环境，或选择已连接的电脑及项目，然后描述任务。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：Codex 移动版中面向已连接电脑的新任务编辑界面。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"explore-setup-and-security\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">查看设置与安全信息</h2> <p>了解电脑要求、设备管理、权限和故障排查方法。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">阅读远程连接指南</a></p>","en":"<h1 id=\"codex-on-mobile\">Codex on mobile</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"start-guide-and-review-tasks-from-your-phone\">Start, guide, and review tasks from your phone</h2> <p>Follow progress, approve actions, and send instructions from your phone. Codex runs tasks in the cloud or on a connected computer.</p> <p>Use the ChatGPT mobile app with Cloud or a connected Mac or Windows PC. Availability depends on rollout and your workspace settings.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Interactive Codex experience in the ChatGPT mobile app showing Cloud, connected computers, tasks, conversations, approvals, and changed files</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"start-here\">Start here</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e49d01f23299a44c?anchor=set-up-remote\">Set up mobile access</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">Remote connections guide</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"codex-on-mobile-advantages\">Codex on mobile advantages</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Start tasks from your phone:</strong> Choose Cloud and an environment, or a connected computer and project, then describe the task.</li> <li><strong>Guide work as it happens:</strong> Open a task, follow its progress, and send new instructions without returning to your desk.</li> <li><strong>Approve requested actions:</strong> Review requested commands and actions before Codex continues on your connected computer.</li> <li><strong>Review the result:</strong> Inspect responses, changed files, diffs, and test results, then decide what happens next.</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"set-up-remote\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"get-started-on-mobile\">Get started on mobile</h2> <p>Connect your computer, approve access, and start your first task.</p> <ol> <li><strong>Start setup on your computer.</strong> Open the ChatGPT desktop app on your Mac or Windows PC. Go to <strong>Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Connections</strong> &gt; <strong>Control this Mac or PC</strong> and select <strong>Set up</strong> or <strong>Add</strong>. Approve remote access and complete any requested verification.</li> <li><strong>Scan the QR code.</strong> Scan the code with your phone, sign in to the same ChatGPT account and workspace, and approve the connection. Only connect devices you own and trust.</li> <li><strong>Start working from your phone.</strong> In the ChatGPT mobile app for iOS, open <strong>Codex</strong> to choose your connected computer and start or continue a task. If your mobile app still shows Remote, open it instead. Keep your computer awake and online.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"keep-work-moving-from-anywhere\">Keep work moving from anywhere</h2> <p>Start, approve, and review tasks from your phone. Codex runs the work under your organization’s security policies.</p> <h3 id=\"1-see-tasks-across-your-hosts\">1. See tasks across your hosts</h3> <p>Follow active tasks in Cloud and across connected computers, pick up existing conversations, and see when your input is needed.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex on mobile task list showing Cloud and connected computers</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"2-approve-requests\">2. Approve requests</h3> <p>Review commands and requested actions before Codex continues working on your connected computer.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex on mobile approval request for a terminal command</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"3-review-changed-code\">3. Review changed code</h3> <p>Inspect changed files and diffs from your phone before deciding what happens next.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex on mobile changed-files review with code differences</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"4-start-new-tasks\">4. Start new tasks</h3> <p>Choose Cloud and an environment, or a connected computer and project, then describe the task.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Codex on mobile new-task composer for a connected computer</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"explore-setup-and-security\">Explore setup and security</h2> <p>Learn about computer requirements, device management, permissions, and troubleshooting.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f\">Read the Remote connections guide</a></p>"};
